 ],
 "takeaways": [
  "True solution: homogenised, invisible, no residue (NaCl or CuSO₄ in water).",
  "Colloid: bigger particles, do not settle, pass through filter paper (starch, egg white).",
  "Suspension: visible particles that settle and stay on the filter paper (chalk in water)."
 ]
